# Install as /etc/paperclip/docker-hygiene.env with owner root:root, mode 0644.
# This template is nonsecret: it carries only the volume knob and the kill
# switch, never a credential. The mode bit (--apply) lives in the reviewed
# unit file and cannot be supplied from here.
#
# Prune images and build cache last used more than this many hours ago.
# Default 168 (7 days). Must be a positive integer; anything else refuses
# the run LOUDLY (exit 2) before anything is pruned.
DOCKER_HYGIENE_AGE_HOURS=168
# Docker binary the payload execs (absolute path recommended on the host).
#DOCKER_BIN=/usr/bin/docker
# Kill switch: uncomment to make every run exit after the dry-run report.
#DOCKER_HYGIENE_DISABLED=1
